* => Buffer length for WRITE: SU5
*   #MR-P-BUFFER     (A0)     PDA XXUX---P - temp buffer: each line/call
*     will increase it until buffer flash
*   XS-FIRWC-BUFFER  (A99000) LDA XS-FIL-A - used for CALL to SAT
* Determine length with statements:
* 1. XS-FIRWC-BUFFER := 'X'
*    EXAMINE XS-FI-ABC FOR 'X' GIVING POSITION #I
*    SUBTRACT 1 FROM #I => 1000 ÜÜ 1000=250+10+1+5+10+10+714
*    RESET XS-FIRWC-BUFFER
* 2. length of XS-FI-COMMON (A300):
*    EXAMINE FULL XS-FI-COMMON FOR FULL ' ' GIVING NUMBER #I => 300 ÜÜ
************************************************************************
* Supported NPR Unix Functions:
